# What must never enter the build context.
#
# The first two entries are the important ones: the build context is uploaded to
# the builder, so a customer drawing listed here is a drawing that does not leave
# this machine (§35). .git is excluded for the same reason as much as for size.

Inputs/
samples/
validation/
*.dwg
*.dxf

.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json
credentials.json

.git/
.github/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Not needed at runtime: the suite, the local tooling and the docs.
tests/
tools/
docs/
*.md
!README.md

audit*.png
audit*.json
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
